hi I'm Evan Carmichael welcome to  another edition of ask Evan in today's  episode I'm going to answer a question  from one of my readers Tom who was an  aspiring entrepreneur and wants to know  if he should include video on his  website or not so Tom I love the use of  video I think you can use it for two  main reasons the first is to quickly  explain what your product or service  does so a lot of people have short  attention spans and a visual learner so  video is a great way to quickly  communicate a message to them if I go to  a website and I get pitched all day long  I have tons of emails come in and people  saying check out my website please and  what do you think of my product or  service if I can quickly hit their  website and see a video that explains  what they do then I can quickly get a  sense of if I want to you know do  something with this company or not if  it's going to take half an hour to dig  in and really figure out what this  business is all about then you're going  to lose most people so I really like the  idea of having a quick video to quickly  explain what your product or service  does to tell prospects who are landing  on your website a great example of this  is Dropbox so if you go to dropbox com  you'll see their homepage is just a  video and it quickly explains the need  and why you can use Dropbox and how you  can use Dropbox and allows you to make a  quick decision if the service is right  for you or not I'm a panelist on a show  called the pitch where entrepreneurs  come on pitch their ideas looking for  capital and in advance we kind of get  the websites of everybody's coming on  the pitch and I'll always go quickly  check it out and see if they have a  video because if I can quickly see a two  minute video that explains what they do  I get a sense of what the company is all  about or if they don't have a video and  I have to kind of dig through pages of  product information that's that's more  cumbersome and I'm less likely to do it  so if you can have that quick video it  goes a long way to being able to make an  impact with people who are visiting your  site the second type of video that can  also be really helpful is having  testimonials so if you have people from  your client base or people who've worked  with you in the past say how great you  are that goes a long way to establishing  credibility with new people who are  coming to visit your website so if you  create a video with you saying how great  you are of course you're gonna say how  great you are cuz  your own products of service so people  will take that with a grain of salt and  may not believe it too much but if you  have your clients coming on and people  work with you in the past and they're  saying how great you are then people who  are visiting your site looking at that  there's a little bit more credibility  and they're more likely you're going to  want to work with you I said I'd give  you to tip so I'm gonna give you one  more because it just came to mind is  we're recording this another thing that  could be really helpful for you is if  you talk a little bit about yourself I  find that people like buying from people  instead of companies and this was a  mistake I made earlier on with my  business where the company was Evan  chemical calm but all i did was profile  famous entrepreneurs and i was never  involved and people are asking who's  Evan chemical where is he we should see  more of him and so I started you know  putting myself on there more and  creating these videos and I think for  any company is an opportunity for the  founder to create a relationship with  their customers our client base and  website visitors by creating a quick  intro video talk a little bit but you  talk about your story talked about why  you started your business and people are  more interested in that than just your  kind of company overview standard bio so  it's a three-way I think you can really  use video to get people to know you like  you'll want to work with you so  hopefully that was helpful I love to  hear you guys have to think if you want  to leave a comment under the video and  if you like the video please give it a  thumbs up I always appreciate those and  stay tuned for next episode  you
 

